<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung Co H1 net slightly rises yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Samsung Co H1 net slightly rises yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		    272     vs    292</p>
<p>    Net			     18.94  vs     18.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		  13,295.30  vs 11,617.29</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	   20.44  vs     26.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Samsung Co is a foreign trading and construction unit of the Samsung Group. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
